speechtext:
Mr. Speaker, I have many other arguments. For instance, the newspaper La Tribune in the eastern townships published a score of articles on that subject. In fact, they were published in the following issues:	Monday, September 16, page 16;
Wednesday, September 18, page 20, Thursday, September 19, pages 1 and 9, Friday, September 20, pages 1 and 2, Thursday, September 26, page 2; Tuesday, October 1, page 2, Wednesday, October 2, page 2, Thursday, October 3, pages 2 and 7, Saturday, October 5, page 4, and Tuesday, October 8, page 5.
At this point, I want to quote that of September 20-
